<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰγων-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fight before,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὧν προηγώνισθε</span> from <i>the
				contests you have before had,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ προηγωνισμένη δύναμις</span>
			not <i>having been engaged before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				3.7.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προηγωνισμένοι ἀγῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν οὖν τῶν λόγων προηγώνιστο
					αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Eun.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fight in front of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμόνες τῶν ὑποτεταγμένων
					προαγωνιζόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα προαγωνιζομένη τῆς φάλαγγος ὅλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.16
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.379
			</span></i>; <i>fight for</i> or <i>in defence of</i> another,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>plead in behalf of,</i> c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἀθηναίων οὐ μικρὸν ἀγώνισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.18.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
